{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 92246, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 64777, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "人偶星图", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1637210804, "updated_at": 1657883021, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1657882913, "last_at": 1657883021, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "太空漫步太空漫步※太空漫步为新的常驻日常副本，分为简单和困难和极难三个大关卡。每一关由8个星云组成（下图的卡片每一关有八张），每一个星云有八个星星组成，和一个boss关（星云之主）组成，每一个星星由八", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637211561540_70959535.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_502/h_884/1164/176744/2022/6/15/992324.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_901/1164/176744/2022/6/15/927253.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 12, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 13005, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 92246, "content": "<div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">太空漫步</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">太空漫步</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\">※<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">太空漫步为新的常驻日常副本，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">分为简单和困难和极难三个大关卡。每一关</span>由8个星云组成（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">下图的卡片每一关有八张</span>），每一个<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">星云</span>有八个<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">星星</span>组成，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\">和一个</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">boss关（星云之主）</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">组成，</span>每一个<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">星星</span>由八个<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">小关</span>（区域 ZONE，每一小关还有八个小小关）。人话：8个新副本，每个副本分8小关小关还有8个小小关，和一个boss关，加上boss的话一共<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">513</span>关，8x8x8 +1关</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">※右上角的报酬根据你</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">总通关层数</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">可每日领取一次。简单最高可领48张紫票，困难可领48张红票，极难可领黄票。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span></span></span></span>星簇之主：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">20人团战boss，可重复攻略（需上一条提到的门票），重复获取奖励。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(177,56,206);\">此游戏模式为主要获取人偶的方式。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">※RAID限定技能改为5人巨型BOSS限定，WB限定技能改为20人巨型BOSS限定</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">星云页面</span></div></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>左边三个按钮分别是：详情，星云关卡列表，通关奖励。</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>右按钮：每日奖励。（通过的星云越多，奖励越多）</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\">下图为例，该页面为一个星云，8个星云为一个星簇，每个星云上面有8个星星，每个星星点进去有8小关和一个BOSS（星云之主）</div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637211561540_70959535.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637211561540_70959535.jpg\" style=\"\" data-width=\"601\" data-height=\"999\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">星云通关奖励页面</span></div></div></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\">奖励依次是：（此奖励是一次性的）<br></div></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1. 魂卡一张。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2.少量稀有</span></span></span></span></span>人偶制作材料。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">4. 二星棉花，人偶升级材料，类似天子的经验史莱姆。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">5. 1000钻石。</span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"502\" data-height=\"884\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_502/h_884/1164/176744/2022/6/15/992324.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_502/h_884/1164/176744/2022/6/15/992324.png\"></div><br></div><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">每日奖励页面</span></div></div></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">每日奖励为&lt;星簇之主&gt;门票，1星难度十票打一次，2星难度二十票打一次。星簇之主类似wb，20人团战，可以重复打，重复领取奖励。<br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">紫色门票对应<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&lt;星簇之主&gt;</span>简单模式，红色对应<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&lt;星簇之主&gt;</span>困难模式，通过简单8-1-1即可每日获得48紫色门票，通过困难8-1-1即可获得48紫色+48红色门票。越早打完越早领更多门票，推荐提早打完。</span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">推到推不动再领每日奖励。</span></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"901\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_901/1164/176744/2022/6/15/927253.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_901/1164/176744/2022/6/15/927253.png\"></div><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">星簇之主</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">类似WB的20人团战，完成星云（太空漫步）简单模式可挑战1星难度，完成星云<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">（太空漫步）</span>困难模式可挑战2星难度和狐狸，击杀不了也可以领取奖励（非常少，而且消耗门票，纯属浪费，<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">打不过就把票攒着，票不过期</span>）。</span><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">注意！天子的装备和魂卡在此模式下无效！！</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);font-size:14px;\">门票获取途径：星云（太空漫步）每日奖励</span><br style=\"\"></span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637212277344_12165132.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637212277344_12165132.jpg\" style=\"\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"999\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">星簇之主奖励页面</span></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">按照所造成的伤害分段给奖励。</span></span><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\">击杀奖励给<span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,176,80);\">人偶券</span>，和一些材料。</span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"579\" data-height=\"950\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_579/h_950/1164/176744/2022/6/15/372651.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_579/h_950/1164/176744/2022/6/15/372651.png\"></div><br></div></span></div></span></div></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">人偶</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">人偶</div></div></span></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">获得方式</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\">以下为韩服获得方式，日服没有公布，可能有改动</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">1. 打&lt;太空漫步&gt;星簇boss，</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">2. 铁匠打造</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">3. 氪金</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">逐个分析：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">铁匠：材料难得而且锻造紫色一个需要100W玛瑙，此途径获取玩偶的数量十分有限。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">氪金：560一个紫色玩偶 ？！（巨氪专属）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\">太空漫步：推完星云明天给48张乳贴boss门票和48张狐狸boss门票，1星十票打一次，击杀给一张玩偶票，一天稳定获得6个玩偶？打不过没关系，票可以攒着，等有实力的时候再来打。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">人偶页面</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">每个天子新增一个挂件槽，用于放置玩偶，只能佩戴和天子属性相同的玩偶（同属性即可）。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"576\" data-height=\"946\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_946/1164/176744/2022/6/15/318637.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_576/h_946/1164/176744/2022/6/15/318637.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">人偶功能</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">主要功能：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">※强化天子的技能</span><br style=\"\"></div><span style=\"\">例1：佩戴【暗月月玩偶】强化了两个技能，翻译如下：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);\">普通技能强化：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">强化1：一名暗属性攻击性友军获得双刃（攻击力增加100%并且防御减低），持续10S。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);\">队长技能强化：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">强化1：暗属性队友暴击率增加12.5%</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">有些人偶配合一些老天子简直就是史诗级剧变。说的就是你草莓加斗鸡眼。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(221, 252, 255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">装备卸下</div></div><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">根据所装备人偶的稀有度不同，卸掉消耗的材料也不同，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">紫色人偶需要400材料</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">绿色人偶需要100材料</span>，如果装备的低级玩偶感觉卸掉花费的材料不值的话，可以直接卖掉，返还【玩偶用洗剂】。</span><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213280890_6131380.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213280890_6131380.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"582\" data-height=\"700\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">升级和突破</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">※玩偶升级使用玩偶或者升级材料（棉花），升级其实就是升级技能，等级上限通过加值来提高。</span></span><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213325518_49687023.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213325518_49687023.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"599\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※玩偶类似魂卡，喂+5的玩偶，可以使+0直接成+6。</span><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213368632_94462288.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213368632_94462288.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(221, 252, 255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">玩偶制作</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;普通白色玩偶一万玛瑙，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">绿色罕见玩偶</span>五万玛瑙，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">蓝色稀有玩偶</span>十万玛瑙，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">紫色玩偶</span>二十五万玛瑙，<span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">橙色传说</span>玩偶五十万</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213443763_61670550.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213443763_61670550.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"999\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">通过解体可使低级玩偶小概率升一级。<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">紫色</span>升级<span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">橙色</span>的概率是16%且有的玩偶不能靠分解得到。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"578\" data-height=\"731\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_731/1164/176744/2022/6/15/415334.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_731/1164/176744/2022/6/15/415334.png\"></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(221,252,255);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);\">透视画馆</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">全新buff系统</span>，但这个不是单一buff，而是所有buff一起生效！！一共56个buff。分为pvp和pve和全部生效三种buff，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">放到buff中的玩偶不能使用</span>，所以必须是闲置的玩偶。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">而且这个和RB的加成一样，效果和你放进去的玩偶等级相关。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">buff要求分别是</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1. 2个传说buff&nbsp; &nbsp;= 10 个闲置的传说玩偶</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2. 8个史诗buff&nbsp; &nbsp;= 40 个闲置的史诗玩偶</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">3. 13个稀有buff = 65 个闲置的稀有玩偶</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">4. 16个罕见buff = 80&nbsp;个罕见的稀有玩偶</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">5.17个普通buff&nbsp; = 85&nbsp;个罕见的稀有玩偶</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">以上是所有一级buff生效的条件，buff要升到满级，上面的这些全都要升到70级，这还都是闲置的，真正自己使用的不算。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213525536_39037823.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213525536_39037823.jpg\" style=\"\" data-width=\"599\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213567425_41067130.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637213567425_41067130.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"655\" data-height=\"1073\"></div></div></span></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">总结</span></div></div></div></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div style=\"background: transparent;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;人偶系统的更新可以说使dc的一些排名和天子的用法有了质变，但是过难的星云和boss，还有高昂的养成材料来看，这个系统就是dc出给大佬的新玩法。属于是拉高全体上限。<br></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;无欲无求的大佬可以开始去<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">赌高稀有</span>或者<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">优先提升低级玩偶等级</span>塞进玩偶乡来提升buff。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;萌新的或者说还没有到达wb五千万阶段的所有玩家建议尽可能的<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">先推星云</span>，佛系发展即可。</span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span><br style=\"\">#<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">注意人偶的技能其实就相当于給你的天子ss增加一个效果，上的buff或者debuff是会重叠的。所以用玩偶的时候要思考应用场景是否会重叠buff反而拉你全队后腿</span><br style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span><br></div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637211561540_70959535.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_502/h_884/1164/176744/2022/6/15/992324.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_901/1164/176744/2022/6/15/927253.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "last_ip_area": "日本", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746